          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eky'okubanza eky'okwezi okw'omwaka ogwa ikumi na gumu ogw'okuzaahisibwa kwaitu, MUKAMA akangambira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe mwana w'omuntu, Taya nkooku yagambire hali Yerusaalemu eti: ‘Otyo, kyakurugaha irembo ly'amahanga lihenzirwe, likinguliirwe nyowe; ninyija kwongerwaho bingi, habwokuba efoirwe kitongo,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikyo MUKAMA arukugambira ati: Iwe Taya, hati omanye nkooku ndi munyanzigwa wawe, ninyija kwohereza amahanga maingi gakuseesire, nk'enyanja oku ereeta ebigonzi byayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Galissesa ebisiika bya Taya gacwacwane eminaara yarwo; nukwo nduharagateho itaka lyarwo, ndufoole mwandara ogutaroho kantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruliikara hagati y'enyanja, rube kiikaro eky'okwanikahoga obutimba, habwokuba MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: eki, nyowe MUKAMA, ninyowe nkigambire, rulinyagwa amahanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi bahara baarwo aba ha mukungu baliitwa empirima. Abantu nubwo balimanya nkooku ndi MUKAMA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Habwokuba MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: Orubuga Taya, ninyija kuruleetera Nebbukadaneeza omukama wa Bbabbulooni, omukama anyakukirra kimu boona, mwihe ha bukiizi obw'emoso, aije n'embaraasi n'ebigaali, abatembi b'embaraasi n'ihe ry'abaserikale baingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bawe aba ha mukungu alibaisa empirima; alyombeka ekisiika eky'okukugota akikwehingulirize, alituuma entuumo y'itaka agikwehingulirize, kandi alikurwanisa akwasire engabu, naayema omu rusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliseesa ebisiika byawe n'empinju kaseesa bisiika, kandi alihendahenda eminaara yawe nendyamiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embaraasi ze, ziriba nyingi muno, ecuucu ei zirukwimukya, erikusweka; obu aliba naataaha amalembo gawe, nk'omuntu oku aba naataaha orubuga orunyakuhagwirwe etoko ey'abatembi b'embaraasi, ey'ebigaali n'ebigaali, eritengeesa ebisiika byawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enguudo zawe alizirubarubatirra n'enkangaasi z'embaraasi ze, abantu bawe alibaisa empirima; kandi enyomyo zawe enkooto, aliziteera hansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balinyaga itungo lyawe, balyaaya ebintu byawe eby'obusuubuzi; baliseesa ebisiika byawe, bacwekereze amaju gawe amarungi; amabaale gawe, embaaho zawe nitaka lyawe lyonyini, balibiseesa omu maizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 18:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiculeereza kimu ebizina byawe byona, kandi endongo zawe tizirigaruka kuhulirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndikufoora mwandara-musa ogutaroho kantu; oliba kiikaro eky'okwanikwahoga obutimba; tolyongera kwombekwa buhyaka; habwokuba MUKAMA naagamba ati, nyowe MUKAMA eki ninyowe nkigambire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagambira Taya ati: Abantu obu balihurra okugwa kwawe, bakahurra abantu bawe emputa abarukusinda, ebintu ebihwerekeriire omu bisiika byawe, ebizinga tibiritengeeta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 18:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, abalemi boona ab'enyanja, baliruga ha bitebe byabo eby'obukama basirimuke beyiheho busuuti zaabo, beejuule ebyokujwara byabo ebihunzirwe; balikwatwa akatukumo; baliikarra hansi, baikale nibakankana, nibahunirra muno habw'ebikubaireho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
